top a speeding train!<br /> <br /> <br /> Mimir's Wisdom + Eye of Heaven = Take a trip to Vegas, cheat in all the poker tournaments.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-30T20:06:22-07:00","id":1145707,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1135731-fun-activities-as-a-beast?p=1145668#post1145668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While using Wings of the Raptor, fly over a Hero's car and drop a shit on it.<br /> <br /> <br /> Run Away + You Can Not Run = Watch the victim run around in circles screaming like an idiot.<br /> <br /> <br /> Titanic Blow + Cyclopean Strength + Unbreakable = Stop a speeding train!<br /> <br /> <br /> Mimir's Wisdom + Eye of Heaven = Take a trip to Vegas, cheat in all the poker tournaments.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice though one correction, most nightmares don't stack.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong> Beast pg 155</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> An individual can only be subject to one active Nightmare<br /> at a time. If the Beast invokes a second Nightmare on the same<br /> target, the new Nightmare supersedes the old one. If a different<br /> Beast does so, the attempt triggers a Clash of Wills</div> </div> </div> </div>I know its sad, I'd considered wonderful things like tying Run Away to a satiety boosted You Are Lost.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-30T20:32:20-07:00","id":1145711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1135731-fun-activities-as-a-beast?p=1145707#post1145707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nice though one correction, most nightmares don't stack.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I know its sad, I'd considered wonderful things like tying Run Away to a satiety boosted You Are Lost.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Well, nothing says you or a friend can't take turns spamming the two. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T17:02:07-08:00","id":1175310,"title":"","content":"Not sure if this counts, but I did find it...<i>satisfying </i>to see people's reactions a few months ago, when I walked around a shopping mall wearing an <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><u><b>IT</b></u> </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">T-shirt, while holding a </span><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>red</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> balloon.*<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">*I am not a mod, nor am I pretending to be one. Colors should belong to everyone.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div> &quot;A free society is one in which it is safe to be unpopular.&quot;<br /> <span style=\"color:DarkRed\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS\">I find <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwin4NXQzLfXAhVGySYKHV3TDXYQFgg3MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T18:22:52-08:00","id":1175324,"title":"","content":"<b>Low Satiety Infested</b> = Ask people to poke your tummy. If they do, erupt into a swarm of spiders!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>High Satiety You Must Obey</b> = Command the obnoxiously loud neighbor to call in a noise complaint on his own party!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Satiety Expenditure Wings of the Raptor</b> = Go sky diving with your friends. Pretend that your parachute fails to open properly!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-18T08:20:34-08:00","id":1187292,"title":"","content":"Satiety Expenditure on Monster from the Deep during a Basketball game, smacking away their ball like an invisible wall. Just out of spite. Bonus: You're just watching that game as a spectator, and may or may not have placed a bet on the other team.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"h