iver a supersonic suckerpunch at the end. Spend two Satiety, Cyclopean Strength gives you automatic successes so you don't have to worry about breaking the chain, use the rules for pulling blows to ensure you're only dealing scratch damage, and you can chain attack your way through any densely packed urban setting at the speed of sound, leaving a lot of very confused mortals rubbing their faces and wondering what the hell hit them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T08:57:44-07:00","id":1194265,"title":"","content":"No way that works","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T09:23:28-07:00","id":1194270,"title":"","content":"If I was ST I'd let that definitly work for the hilarity of it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T09:55:38-07:00","id":1194278,"title":"","content":"Beast in general has a bit of a problem with not defining sensible upper limits for powers. Remember, Wings of the Raptor can get weapon modifiers in the <b>thousands </b>if you punch somebody at the end of a skydive. Personally I cap it at +10 when you hit terminal velocity... but that's not how the rule is written in the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T10:52:44-07:00","id":1194300,"title":"","content":"To be fair, if you manage to Arrange things just so you can pull that off, you deserve that moment of awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T10:54:00-07:00","id":1194302,"title":"","content":"I wrote a Really Dumb post","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":7920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","user":"Master Aquatosic","date":". 03-11-2018, 02:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T03:06:29-07:00","id":1194476,"title":"","content":"Hitching a ride with low Satiety &quot;Crushing Coils&quot; is easy, simply grab on to the next passing car or truck!<br /> Using Doppelgangers to cause Deja-Vus and freak out the iceman etc.<br /> Confuse people by using Enemy Within Sat Expenditure and accusse the other person of being an imposter. Bonus: Use the You are an Imposter Nightmare on them.<br /> Use Illusion of Safety to make blueprints of various locations and hand them out like candy. &quot;Area 51? Yeah, sure!&quot; Use Sat Expenditure to make people literally go missing.<br /> Bitch-slap annoying people on the other platform with low-satiety lightning strike, then carry on.<br /> Use Plague Bearer to make sure annoying people are sick the next day. Use low satiety Plague Bearer to make sure EVERYBODY is sick the next day. Bonus: you're a doc, and after your treatment, people start feeling better again.<br /> Ravenous Maw + Sleight of Hand Merit: steal people's train tickets and eat them. Watch as they get kicked off the train or have to pay a fine.<br /> Use low Satiety Shadow Stalker to lay a wrong lead and convince a guy that he's the antichrist: &quot;I called down Lightning on that guy's car! He cut me off, and I was so angry, and I damned him, and then it struck, and for a split second, I saw what my Soul really looked like! When my boss fired me, I got so angry I hit the table, and it practicly splintered!&quot; Make sure to use manipulation and empathy to set this up properly =P<br /> <br /> Skin deep.... Use that for Halloween.<br /> Use death of light to make sure you have some privacy on the train. Bring ear plugs to drown out the screaming.<br /> Vengeful Earth: You are the master of an &quot;Ancient&quot; martial art... =P<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T05:35:00-07:00","id":1209197,"title":"","content":"Use From the Shadows to sneak into the houses and eat all the food that had just been cooked. <br /> Offer trips to the afterlife on the craigslist. Go through with the offer. <br /> Use From The Shadows to fly for free wherever you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","name":"Warpwind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T07:53:08-07:00","id":1209244,"title":"","content":"Sending explosive packages tailored to kill a single person deserving of it via mail to feed your hunger of ruin and vengeance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":""