ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","name":"Warpwind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T04:14:57-07:00","id":1213372,"title":"","content":"<b>Enemy Within + Infernal Machine</b> : &quot;Yup. That's who just caused your car to crash: the legendary, unassuming Antichrist Toddler in his Stroller of Doom. And no, nobody will ever believe you if you say them so.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Alien Allure, Enemy Within (or Doppelganger), Alien Mindset, Primordial Cult</b>:<br /> 1) Appear to one group as the Archangel, sent by the Almighty Deity to ward them against the sins of the wicked.<br /> 2) Appear to a second group as the Prince of Darkness and Ruler of Hell, coming to them to free them from religion.<br /> 3) Lead the zealots in holy crusades and conversion sprees against the satanists, indulging in your Hunger for Punishment.<br /> 4) When it bores you, switch to Transgression, and join your satanists cultists as they corrupt and debase everything and everyone... including your zealots.<br /> 5) Every mistake or bad deed you make, just say to each cult the other's responsible (in a sense, that is true, after alll....). Let them escalate in retaliation while eating the metaphorical pop-corn of their breaking point.<br /> 6) When a Hero comes, convince both cults he's the other cult's Chosen One, and enjoy seeing both conspirations go on a rampage to kill him.<br /> 7) If all of this REALLY bores you, just add a group of nihilistic atheists and the Hunger for Ruin.<br /> <br /> <b>Ravenous Maw (Satiety Expenditure), Connected Lair, Well-Stocked Lair: </b>Attend airports and stations, selling your Lair as a free hotel room for thrill seekers seasoned to the World of Darkness. Bonus point if you have a Horrorspawn clerk and/or Thrall staff within your Lair.<br /> <br /> Use Horrorspawn and Horrospawn Minions efficiently:<ul><li>A Makara working at Greenpeace, raising the corpse of the whales and sharks killed by poachers.</li> <li>An Eshmaki crazy cat-lady, whose dead cats now frighten the whole neighborhood for her.</li> <li>A crazy Namtaru who will only imbue <i>one </i>of the wasps in the nest inside his roof with a Minion Horrorspawn... but over-charge it with Dread Powers to make it the deadliest and most hard-to-spot killing machine that ever lived. (Also works on moskitoes).</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11431,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11431-adrasalieth","user":"Adrasalieth","date":". 07-17-2018, 08:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11431-adrasalieth","name":"Adrasalieth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T03:38:03-07:00","id":1214981,"title":"","content":"<b>Titanic Blow</b> - Lure a Hero out to the sports field for your climactic battle. Send them flying through the goal post while screaming <i>&quot;Goooooallll!&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Alien Allure, Cyclopeon Strength</b> - Enter weight lifting competitions, make the other contestants feel inadequate.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Mimir's Wisdom, We Know All Your Secrets</b> - Proclaim you have discovered the answer to life's mysteries. Offer to answer one question a year for anybody who passes your trial. If they pass, make it so that literally the first question out of their mouths is the one you answer. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Wings of the Raptor, Cyclopean Strength, Flying and Falling</b> - Take your friends on a roller coaster joy ride over the city streets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T12:04:22-07:00","id":1235669,"title":"","content":"Vengeful Earth: Trip up people from afar.<br /> Titanic Blow: Rule at Karate brick breaking tournaments<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T12:00:30-07:00","id":1236045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1135731-fun-activities-as-a-beast?p=1214981#post1214981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <b>Alien Allure, Cyclopeon Strength</b> - Enter weight lifting competitions, make the other contestants feel inadequate.</div> </div> </di