mber/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-18T11:51:03-07:00","id":1236502,"title":"","content":"Storm-Lashed, yet again - work on building an array capable of harnessing and storing the electrical energy from your lightning strikes. Smugly drive your electric car everywhere and tell people how low your power bill is each month.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-22T09:54:03-07:00","id":1237778,"title":"","content":"<b>Titanic Blow + Storm-Lashed:</b> Send your enemy flying through the air with the first strike, then blow them out of the sky with the second!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Wings of the Raptor + Titanic Blow:</b> Crash through the ceiling when entering a room. Leave in the same fashion you arrived!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>From the Darkness + Infested:</b> <i>&quot;How the hell do they keep getting in here!?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Alien Allure + Basilisk's Touch:</b> Spend the weekends communing with your spirit animal, <i>the poison dart frog!</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394